From: Andrew Branson <andrew.branson@jolla.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 18:30:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 079/156] *mb2-prepare* Export embedding entry point

ESR140 restricts libxul exports with an explicit symbol list.
Export the EmbedLite accessor so external embedding clients can link.

Mb2-scrape: filename=0106-sailfishos-embedlite-Export-embedding-entry-point.patch
---
 toolkit/library/libxul.symbols | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/toolkit/library/libxul.symbols b/toolkit/library/libxul.symbols
index e63e3e74426b..167ddb9cf349 100644
--- a/toolkit/library/libxul.symbols
+++ b/toolkit/library/libxul.symbols
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 XRE_GetBootstrap
+XRE_GetEmbedLite
 uprofiler_get
 #ifdef XP_IOS
 MainProcessInit
